  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Harnessing the power of AI to promote equal opportunities in the digit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposal will target four countries to translate the Recommendation on the Ethics of AI into national institutional and regulatory frameworks and to build a national consensus on the shared vision for AI. At the end of this project, these countries will have national AI strategies developed from a bottom-up approach and their capacities enhanced based on an ethical framework. A meta-strategy will be developed for the global roll-out, based on the evidence and experience gained by the four pilots.</narrative>
  </description>
